 their dedication to maintain the high levels of service…", "a": "Dr. Michael J. Hartnett, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1324948/000121390026083672/ea029998301ex99-1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-15", "n": 3.49, "z": 0.11, "rz": 1.43, "earn": true, "q": "We closed out fiscal year 2026 with another strong quarter, driven by continued expansion in our Aerospace & Defense segment and accelerating growth in our Industrial business. As we look ahead to fiscal year 2027, we remain highly encouraged by the strength of our operating environment and the momentum we are seeing a…", "a": "Dr. Michael J. Hartnett, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1324948/000121390026057223/ea029100901ex99-1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-05", "n": 5.93, "z": 2.77, "rz": 4.43, "earn": true, "q": "We are pleased that we were able to deliver another strong quarter of results, driven by continued momentum in our Aerospace & Defense business and steady performance in our Industrial business. We are well-positioned for growth in calendar year 2026 and beyond, given our robust, growing backlog, which has continued to…", "a": "Dr. Michael J. Hartnett, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1324948/000121390026012574/ea027571601ex99-1_rbcbear.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-31", "n": 2.67, "z": -0.42, "rz": -0.89, "earn": true, "q": "Our performance during the second quarter achieved a very high standard as demand from many of our core markets reached unprecedented levels. We were well prepared to support the generational expansion taking place in these aerospace and defense markets and are pleased to recognize the outstanding performance reached b…", "a": "Dr. Michael J. Hartnett, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1324948/000121390025104431/ea026253801ex99-1_rbcbear.htm"}, {"d": "2025-08-0